1
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:06,160
Taming The Husband

2
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,920
Episode 4

3
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,480
He had the nerve to trick me!

4
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,720
I grabbed him,

5
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,720
and he signed it, fingerprint and all!

6
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:31,880
Each family rank has its own token.

7
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,800
This jade bracelet

8
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,880
is the token for the Heaven rank.

9
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:37,840
What do you think?

10
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:39,480
I…

11
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,160
I think I'm thirsty.

12
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:56,360
If you have a question, just ask.

13
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:01,440
How do the Xies move up in rank?

14
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:12,080
Lady Jin,

15
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,680
anyone who does
the Xie family a great service

16
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:17,000
can be recommended by the clan elders.

17
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,440
With Madam's approval,

18
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,640
they can then rise in rank.

19
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,560
Then what counts as great service?

20
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:27,960
Completing an important task
for the Xies would count.

21
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,360
For instance,

22
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:31,960
Yangzhou's shipping festival
is in early March.

23
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,840
The great families and shipping guilds

24
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,400
will all compete.

25
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:39,880
The winner will receive the government's
largest shipping contract.

26
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:42,080
That would count.

27
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,200
Would you like to see it?

28
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,320
I'd like to do more than watch.

29
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,560
I want to prove my worth!

30
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,640
Look at me.

31
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:54,400
I'm good with words and numbers,
and I can fight!

32
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,880
Matron Fang has served us for years.

33
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,680
You've only just arrived,

34
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,360
and we have many rules.

35
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,760
You should learn from her.

36
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,680
Once you've learned our ways,

37
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,480
we can discuss it again.

38
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:11,840
Are you saying I've broken the rules?

39
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,760
My dear,

40
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,080
you handled that so well,

41
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,640
I was very pleased.

42
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,560
Why would I blame you?

43
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:23,280
But the Xies are a distinguished family.

44
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,200
We must have rules to live by.

45
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:29,200
You'll have to receive guests.

46
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,080
At the shipping festival,

47
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:35,480
people will be watching
our family very closely.

48
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Xi is a little too lively.

49
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,560
If she could stay by Matron Fang's side

50
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,520
to learn manners and gain experience,

51
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,680
then in future, whether here at home

52
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,000
or out visiting people,

53
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,840
she'd cause far less trouble.

54
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:54,600
Madam, please do us a kindness.

55
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:58,360
Let Matron Fang teach Xi, too.

56
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,960
Listen to you.

57
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,640
When have I ever refused?

58
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:03,480
Thank you, Madam.

59
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,240
I grew up in the countryside, too.

60
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,200
I'm speaking from experience.

61
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,000
It'll do you good.

62
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:15,040
Take your time. You'll get the hang of it.

63
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,120
Jianwei.

64
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,360
I know I'm hard to get along with.

65
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,600
You've served me for years.

66
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,080
You must have your grievances.

67
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:28,360
Whatever you're planning,
make me your target.

68
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,640
Why drag others into it?

69
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,880
No. That's not it.

70
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,760
It's because…

71
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,360
My mother got sick recently.

72
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,000
I don't have any money.

73
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,400
<i>And now,</i>

74
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,280
<i>you turn your nose up at good tea?</i>

75
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,880
<i>Do you think these leaves</i>

76
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,640
<i>aren't as good as</i>
<i>someone else's used tea leaves?</i>

77
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:53,240
<i>I've heard mistakes happen</i>
<i>when you rush the math.</i>

78
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,440
<i>Could you check their work for me?</i>

79
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,320
<i>Then tell me what you find.</i>

80
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:01,560
<i>Then I will brew you a cup of fine tea.</i>

81
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,480
<i>Ma'am! Ma'am! Ma'am!</i>

82
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:13,880
<i>Ma'am! Ma'am!</i>

83
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,880
<i>Take a break. I'll do it.</i>

84
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,400
<i>All right.</i>

85
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,080
That night,

86
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,480
you said you'd collect the debt
the next day.

87
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,880
I wanted Miss Xi to pay me,

88
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:37,160
so while you were asleep,
I tore out the entries.

89
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,000
I regretted it at once.

90
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:40,560
And…

91
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,240
I was too ashamed
to ask for the money.

92
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,440
You really are a fool.

93
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,320
You did the job,
and never even got paid.

94
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,440
That's your first mistake.

95
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,480
Someone put you up to it,

96
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,080
yet you don't know who's behind it.

97
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,480
That's your second.

98
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,080
Am I right,

99
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,200
Yingtao?

100
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,680
I don't understand
what you mean, my lord.

101
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,560
If you've done nothing wrong,

102
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:15,840
why didn't you tell your mistress?

103
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,280
I thought

104
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:20,400
Jianwei would tell you, my lord.

105
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,840
In other words,

106
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,040
you knew he was watching

107
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,800
and saw what he was planning.

108
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:29,880
But instead of stopping him,
you helped him along.

109
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,840
<i>Ma'am! Ma'am! Ma'am!</i>

110
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,120
<i>Ma'am! Ma'am!</i>

111
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,280
<i>Take a break. I'll do it.</i>

112
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,680
<i>All right.</i>

113
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,800
Grandmother trusts you.

114
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,640
That's why she sent you to serve us.

115
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:00,000
I held my tongue earlier

116
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,880
out of respect for Grandmother.

117
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,400
I may have a bad temper,

118
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,200
but I won't make you stay.

119
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,280
If you don't want to serve us,

120
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,000
go tell her that yourself.

121
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:12,880
Pack your things
and get out of this house.

122
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,760
My lord!

123
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,160
My lord, I'm truly sorry!

124
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,320
My lord!

125
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,480
Please don't send me away.

126
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,760
I grew up here.

127
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,400
It's freezing outside.

128
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,200
Where could I go?

129
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,240
My lord, please!

130
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,440
They all say you value old ties.

131
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,480
And what history do you and I share?

132
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,560
Xie Yan!

133
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,600
I've barely left, and you're
already bullying someone.

134
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,520
Why are you crying?

135
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,760
Get up.

136
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:50,720
She used to serve my grandmother.

137
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,000
She didn't want to serve you.

138
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,760
The second branch found out

139
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:56,880
and offered her money
to tear pages out of the ledger.

140
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,680
She was too scared to do it,

141
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,560
so she put Jianwei up to it.

142
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,800
You didn't want to serve me.

143
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:12,080
I can see why.

144
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,200
Yingtao,

145
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:16,680
if you want to leave, just nod.

146
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,960
I'll ask Madam to let you go back.

147
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:33,880
If you say nothing,

148
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,280
I'll take it you're staying.

149
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,280
But you'll still have to be punished,

150
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,880
and so will Jianwei.

151
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:41,880
Madam said...
What's that saying?

152
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,640
We must have ru-- rules…

153
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:47,400
To live by. That's right.

154
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,480
To live by.

155
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,880
We must have rules to live by.

156
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:54,800
Yingtao, you've been here a long time.

157
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,960
Tell me, what's the proper punishment?

158
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,760
Fifteen strokes of the rod

159
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,040
and six months' wages.

160
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,360
We'll skip the beating.

161
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,480
You'll lose six months' wages,

162
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:04,680
and so will Jianwei.

163
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,280
Don't do it again.

164
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,400
You wouldn't like to see me angry!

165
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,680
Thank you, my lady!

166
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:11,760
Thank you, my lady. Thank you!

167
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,680
Off you go.

168
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:20,880
Thank you, my lord.

169
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,200
Thank you, my lord.

170
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:31,960
One betrayal, and they're out for good.

171
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,280
Don't tell me you're a fool, too.

172
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:36,960
You've kept Jianwei on, haven't you?

173
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,200
He had his reasons.

174
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:41,360
Then perhaps Yingtao had hers, too.

175
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,560
It's enough if she mends her ways.

176
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,480
People…

177
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,640
-What's that saying? No one…
-No one's perfect.

178
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,240
-That's right.
-You fool.

179
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,920
Well, ignorance is bliss.

180
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,080
If you have to
figure out every little thing,

181
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:54,320
you'll wear yourself out.

182
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:02,080
Lady Jin, you're a beginner.

183
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:04,480
Use satin stitch for the orchids.

184
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,440
Just keep the stitches even.

185
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,440
Miss Xi, you know the basics.

186
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:11,480
Add gold-thread couching
around the orchids

187
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,880
for a finer finish.

188
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,280
Men should use plain colors.

189
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:20,480
Use pale blue and cream thread.

190
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:23,960
Young ladies may use
a little lavender or pale pink.

191
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:25,880
But never use bright red.

192
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,760
That's for the principal wife.

193
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,400
What a mess you've made!

194
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:58,720
Jin Baozhu!

195
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,680
You couldn't stand that mine was better,
so you ruined mine, too!

196
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,600
Why are you so horrible?

197
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,200
-She hit me!
-What's your problem?

198
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:07,680
Miss Xi, what are you doing?

199
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,200
I…

200
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,880
Mother!

201
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,680
It was her again!

202
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:17,400
Every time, I see her leave first,

203
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:20,280
and the next thing I know,
my work's been ruined.

204
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:23,960
I don't know what dirty trick she pulled.

205
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:26,440
She got me punished, too!

206
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,400
My darling.

207
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,760
Of course I know.

208
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,200
With those little schemes of hers,

209
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,600
she pretends to be so innocent,

210
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:34,200
but she's setting traps for you.

211
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,280
You lose your composure

212
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,760
in front of Matron Fang

213
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,440
and make a fool of yourself, don't you?

214
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:40,640
Xi, look at me.

215
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,960
From now on, whatever happens,

216
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:45,600
you mustn't make a scene
in front of everyone.

217
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:47,760
-Xie Xi!
-There, there.

218
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:49,240
Use your head.

219
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,120
If she'd really done it,

220
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,480
why would she
have ruined her own work, too?

221
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,280
How can you blame me?

222
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,880
You told me
they'd never get the money back.

223
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,040
I was so excited

224
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,600
to go to the Lus' and watch the fun.

225
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:01,800
And what happened?

226
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:06,880
I ended up the biggest joke of all!

227
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,880
I only told you
to sweet-talk Lu Ziyu a little.

228
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,680
You were meant to use him.

229
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:14,560
Who knew you'd
charge into battle yourself

230
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:15,880
and make yourself a target!

231
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,600
You're a concubine's daughter,

232
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,400
with nothing but a pretty face.

233
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:22,480
You haven't got a brain in your head!

234
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,800
You're insulting me?

235
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,840
Enough.

236
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:28,920
You're a concubine's son yourself!

237
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,640
You--
Who are you to lecture me?

238
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,680
I am a concubine's son,

239
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,200
but at least I've got a brain.

240
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:36,280
Unlike you!

241
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,600
I told you to win over a maid.

242
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:39,920
Instead, you set
the tea down and walked away.

243
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,360
You didn't win her over.

244
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,440
You just handed someone else

245
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,600
a chance to get her on their side.

246
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,800
A maid who thinks she's a princess!

247
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,880
Xie Qiao, I'll kill you!

248
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,280
Enough. Enough!

249
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,480
Stop it.

250
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:54,080
You're both my own flesh and blood.

251
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:57,160
Put that energy
into fighting our enemies together.

252
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:02,560
There, there. Enough.

253
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,360
Qiao,

254
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:09,000
what do you think

255
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,160
we should do?

256
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,160
Come on, give me a compliment.

257
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,960
I embroidered a sparrow, you know.

258
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:55,640
I don't lie.

259
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,480
I hate you.

260
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:24,200
What flower is this?

261
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:28,480
It's a daylily.

262
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:32,080
It's beautifully done.

263
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,480
Who embroidered it?

264
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:34,680
I'd like to get a few tips from her.

265
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,640
You're too late.

266
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:48,240
She's already

267
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:49,720
gone.

268
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,640
Gone? Where?

269
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,400
Didn't you say

270
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:57,280
"Out of sight, out of mind"?

271
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,440
Why bring it back to embroider?

272
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:14,440
Do you think Xie Xi ruined her own
work to pin the blame on me?

273
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,600
But judging by how she acted,
I don't think so.

274
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:26,440
Any ideas?

275
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:30,240
None.

276
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,760
It's so infuriating!

277
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:34,680
When I catch that bastard,

278
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:36,480
I'll knock him flat on his face!

279
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:40,760
Can I put up a shed in your courtyard?

280
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:42,960
What for?

281
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,560
I want to butcher pigs.

282
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,320
I…

283
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,240
Lady Jin says,

284
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:43,560
if she can't butcher pigs,
she can at least cut down trees.

285
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,800
I couldn't stop her.

286
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:48,240
By the sunlit window, a lonely figure.

287
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:50,040
The wind stills, and all is silent.

288
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:52,280
My lord, don't let
the loneliness get you down.

289
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,680
The New Year is almost here.

290
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:54,760
The fourth young master
will soon return--

291
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:55,880
Jianwei.

292
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,480
Go and choose a few
lovely camellias to plant.

293
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:00,560
Only ones with white buds.

294
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:02,880
Yes, my lord.

295
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:04,960
Come back.

296
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:08,000
Pale pink or deep pink ones,

297
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:09,200
if there are any decent ones,

298
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:10,480
choose a few of those, too.

299
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,280
Not too many. They're gaudy.

300
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:14,680
Yes, my lord.

301
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,280
What about heavenly bamboo
and wintersweet?

302
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:21,240
They're in season
and look lovely, too.

303
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:25,280
Heavenly bamboo berries are too showy.

304
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,600
No.

305
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,240
Wintersweet

306
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,280
grows in Xie Qiao's courtyard.

307
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,000
Definitely not.

308
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,600
Yes, my lord.

309
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,160
Come back.

310
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,480
I'll go with you.

311
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,200
Yes, my lord.

312
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,600
It should've been like this ages ago.

313
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,760
So lively and so pretty!

314
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:01,080
A few camellias,

315
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,600
and you're this happy?

316
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:04,400
You fool. What do you know?

317
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,840
Put one in my hair later
to ward off bad luck.

318
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,280
More will bloom in a few days.

319
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,680
Then I want bright red ones.

320
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:12,160
I want rosy pink ones!

321
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,680
I hope you choke on your bad taste.

322
00:19:15,280 --> 00:19:16,360
I hope you choke on your own venom!

323
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:21,920
Jin Baozhu!

324
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:24,280
-Come back.
-No!

325
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,760
One flower's bloomed.

326
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:28,160
You'll regret missing it.

327
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:35,240
Where?

328
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:50,440
Name-change petition
"Zhu" changed from "pig" to "pearl"

329
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:51,760
What's this?

330
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:54,160
A few days ago,
as your husband,

331
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,480
I submitted to your township official
a petition to change your name.

332
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:58,600
And… what's this?

333
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:01,360
This is the household register entry.

334
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:04,280
And these papers are the proof.

335
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:08,480
Read it to me!
What does it say?

336
00:20:11,280 --> 00:20:14,160
"Jin Baozhu, with 'zhu' for 'pig,'

337
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,160
is hereby renamed

338
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:18,160
Jin Baozhu, with 'zhu' for 'pearl.'"

339
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:47,760
"Pearl"

340
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:53,680
will be the first character I teach you.

341
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:17,320
The moon shines bright

342
00:21:38,360 --> 00:21:39,480
Congratulations,

343
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:41,280
Jin Baozhu.

344
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:02,640
The gift you gave me today
made me very happy.

345
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:05,200
To thank you,
I have a gift for you, too.

346
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:10,080
You called me here in the dead of night

347
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:12,360
just to see this?

348
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:22,280
Your ugly handwriting was better.

349
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:23,800
It's not ugly.

350
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:25,960
You just have to look
a little harder to see the beauty.

351
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:27,160
Besides,

352
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:29,080
the gift I have for you
isn't this wooden dummy.

353
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:30,960
It's a grandson.

354
00:22:31,280 --> 00:22:32,280
Thank you.

355
00:22:32,360 --> 00:22:34,880
I've never been a father,
and now I'm a grandfather.

356
00:22:35,880 --> 00:22:37,120
It's that thief

357
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,280
who keeps ruining my work.

358
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:40,160
I can never catch him,

359
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:42,680
but with this wooden dummy,
things will be different.

360
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:46,200
This wooden dummy of mine
can catch thieves.

361
00:22:47,840 --> 00:22:48,960
Catch thieves?

362
00:23:14,800 --> 00:23:16,400
Take that!

363
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:18,560
Take that! Take that!

364
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:20,200
That's for playing tricks
behind my back!

365
00:23:20,280 --> 00:23:21,560
And that's for kicking my dummy!

366
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:22,720
-Stop hitting me!
-That's for kicking my dummy!

367
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:24,000
-And for kicking my dummy!
-Help!

368
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:25,680
-Take that! Take that!
-Help!

369
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:27,240
I've finally caught you!

370
00:23:27,320 --> 00:23:28,320
Stop hitting me!

371
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,480
Someone stop her!

372
00:23:31,680 --> 00:23:32,680
He's my younger brother!

373
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:34,680
-What?
-Yan!

374
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:36,760
Yan!

375
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:50,760
Lady Jin!

376
00:23:50,840 --> 00:23:51,880
Lady Jin!

377
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:53,280
Lady Jin, you can't do this!

378
00:23:54,080 --> 00:23:55,480
What's going on here?

379
00:23:55,760 --> 00:23:56,760
It's my fault.

380
00:23:56,840 --> 00:23:57,840
I couldn't stop Lady Jin.

381
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:59,840
It's not her fault.
If you want, you can punish me.

382
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:02,200
But before you do,
my lady, I want an explanation.

383
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:04,120
You shrew!

384
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,200
I'll tear your hair out!

385
00:24:05,280 --> 00:24:06,400
I'll knock you off your perch

386
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,480
and show you for what you are!

387
00:24:07,560 --> 00:24:09,080
Enough. Sit down.

388
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:11,360
My boy,

389
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:12,560
weren't you on the boat,

390
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:14,360
learning the business from your father?

391
00:24:14,440 --> 00:24:15,560
He isn't back yet.

392
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:17,080
How come you're back before him?

393
00:24:17,280 --> 00:24:19,080
Mother, if I hadn't come back,

394
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,440
those people in the second branch

395
00:24:20,520 --> 00:24:21,600
would've ruined my brother's name!

396
00:24:21,680 --> 00:24:22,880
What are you waiting for?

397
00:24:23,040 --> 00:24:24,760
She dared to tie up a Xie young master!

398
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:26,400
Throw her out at once!

399
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:28,480
Madam, I'm rough around the edges.

400
00:24:28,560 --> 00:24:29,640
I don't mince words.

401
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:31,680
I hear you're kind and generous.

402
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:33,120
If you can put up with him,

403
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,840
you can put up with your
new daughter-in-law, too.

404
00:24:35,080 --> 00:24:36,200
So I'll speak plainly.

405
00:24:36,600 --> 00:24:37,920
I came here with him,

406
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,360
but you haven't so much as looked at me.

407
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:40,640
That's hardly fair, is it?

408
00:24:41,600 --> 00:24:43,080
Still, I did tie up your son,

409
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:44,440
so let's call it even.

410
00:24:45,040 --> 00:24:46,120
From now on,

411
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:47,560
let's say what we mean.

412
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,640
Can we do that or not?

413
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,800
Give me a straight answer.

414
00:24:50,280 --> 00:24:52,240
How dare you?
You're just a village woman!

415
00:24:52,320 --> 00:24:54,000
-You dare speak to my mother like that?
-Yi.

416
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:55,280
-Mother!
-Sit down.

417
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:04,480
Come. You sit, too.

418
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:11,480
My boy was learning the business

419
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:13,400
on the boat with his father.

420
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:15,880
He wasn't due home until New Year.

421
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,480
Today,

422
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:19,320
I was so delighted to see him

423
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:20,760
that I neglected you.

424
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,640
That was rude of me.

425
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:24,560
Please forgive me.

426
00:25:27,680 --> 00:25:29,200
We're family.

427
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:31,000
Of course

428
00:25:32,960 --> 00:25:35,360
we should say what we mean.

429
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:38,000
Good. While Matron Fang
was teaching me,

430
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:39,080
he was sabotaging my work.

431
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,160
I caught him in the act.

432
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:42,080
Wasn't he in the wrong?
Shouldn't you punish him?

433
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:44,480
-Yi.
-Mother.

434
00:25:46,680 --> 00:25:47,840
Don't be hasty.

435
00:25:48,360 --> 00:25:49,480
Let me ask you.

436
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:51,400
Suppose at breakfast today,

437
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:53,920
the food wasn't to my liking,

438
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:56,360
so I broke the cook's hand.

439
00:25:57,080 --> 00:25:58,320
Would you say

440
00:25:58,640 --> 00:26:00,480
that was unfair?

441
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:02,560
Of course it would be.

442
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:03,680
He meant no harm

443
00:26:03,760 --> 00:26:04,880
and hadn't hurt you.

444
00:26:05,360 --> 00:26:06,880
Yi was only protecting his brother.

445
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:09,000
He didn't hurt you, either.

446
00:26:09,680 --> 00:26:11,200
But you hurt him

447
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:13,640
and kept him tied up all night
before dragging him here.

448
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:15,280
Tell me,

449
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:17,800
who's really at fault here?

450
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:18,920
But…

451
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:21,080
Matron Fang punished me because of him.

452
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,680
How is that not hurting me?

453
00:26:24,280 --> 00:26:26,680
He made trouble. I'll deal with him.

454
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:27,760
Matron Fang was unreasonable.

455
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:29,360
Madam will deal with her.

456
00:26:29,800 --> 00:26:31,080
The Xies are a large, powerful family.

457
00:26:31,600 --> 00:26:32,800
If everyone

458
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,640
took matters into their own hands,

459
00:26:35,080 --> 00:26:36,560
we'd have chaos.

460
00:26:37,440 --> 00:26:39,640
Each household must keep its own in line.

461
00:26:40,280 --> 00:26:41,600
That's the rule.

462
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:45,400
Matron Fang has taught
you by example all this time,

463
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:47,480
yet you haven't learned a thing.

464
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:51,360
Why shouldn't she punish you?

465
00:26:56,280 --> 00:26:57,560
Yi deserves punishment.

466
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:00,400
So do you.

467
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:03,640
You ignored the family rules.

468
00:27:03,840 --> 00:27:04,880
For that,

469
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:08,240
he'll copy our family code 100 times.

470
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:10,480
Since you can't read or write well,

471
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:13,040
you're not to go out for half a month.

472
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:15,240
Let that be a lesson to you.

473
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:18,640
Serves you right.

474
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:38,680
My lady, don't be angry.

475
00:27:38,880 --> 00:27:40,280
Please calm down, my lady.

476
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,560
-Jin Baozhu!
-My lady!

477
00:27:44,280 --> 00:27:45,360
Come here.

478
00:27:52,040 --> 00:27:54,120
Didn't you want to learn to read?

479
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:55,200
Read.

480
00:27:56,880 --> 00:27:58,400
"This is outrageous!"

481
00:27:58,480 --> 00:28:00,160
The Southern Dynasties'
"Biography of Yu Cong" records

482
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:01,720
that when the emperor's grandson
and heir was deposed,

483
00:28:01,800 --> 00:28:03,600
Yu Cong privately condemned it:

484
00:28:03,800 --> 00:28:06,600
"Wang and Xu donned military garb
and deposed the emperor!

485
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:08,480
This is outrageous!"

486
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:09,720
What I wrote

487
00:28:09,840 --> 00:28:10,960
were those four characters:

488
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:12,280
"This is outrageous!"

489
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:15,440
Today, we use them to condemn treason

490
00:28:15,560 --> 00:28:16,760
and acts against human decency,

491
00:28:16,840 --> 00:28:19,680
as well as to mock people
who act like utter fools

492
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:21,360
and have no respect for the rules.

493
00:28:22,080 --> 00:28:23,760
Is there a saying for the opposite?

494
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,600
Yes.

495
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:39,440
"Only natural"

496
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:40,880
Since heaven and earth formed from chaos,

497
00:28:41,040 --> 00:28:42,040
there's been a natural order.

498
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,280
It's not open to debate.

499
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:45,680
We call it "only natural."

500
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:47,600
Good.

501
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:49,840
Then I'll use them in a sentence.

502
00:28:50,040 --> 00:28:51,800
When someone takes advantage of others

503
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,560
and thinks it's only natural,

504
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,680
I want to tell them,

505
00:28:54,760 --> 00:28:55,880
"This is outrageous!"

506
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:58,000
You say you're so straightforward.

507
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:00,240
Why not insult me to my face?

508
00:29:01,280 --> 00:29:03,360
I make one little dig at you,
and you can't take it?

509
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:05,320
But your brother insults me to my face,
and you tell me to take it!

510
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:06,560
Do you expect me to be a saint?

511
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:08,120
So you could go to the shipping festival,

512
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,480
I've tried so hard to learn the rules
and put up with all their scolding.

513
00:29:10,560 --> 00:29:11,560
And what do you do?

514
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:12,840
When I got back, you stopped me
from speaking up for myself,

515
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:15,080
then wrote those words to mock me!

516
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:16,240
What's wrong with you?

517
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:17,880
I'm done with this!

518
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,200
Don't be angry, my lord.

519
00:29:19,280 --> 00:29:20,360
Lady Jin was praising you earlier.

520
00:29:22,240 --> 00:29:23,880
Didn't I tell you last night not to go?

521
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:25,880
You dragged him there at daybreak.

522
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,400
They gave you a light punishment.

523
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:28,720
You weren't sent back to that dump

524
00:29:28,800 --> 00:29:30,920
only out of respect for me,
the head of this household.

525
00:29:31,080 --> 00:29:33,000
Instead of thinking about what you did,

526
00:29:33,080 --> 00:29:35,160
you come here shouting orders at me!

527
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:36,320
You, head of the household?

528
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:38,480
You marry a woman,
and think that makes this a home?

529
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:39,680
Let me tell you.

530
00:29:39,760 --> 00:29:41,480
Home is where my heart is.

531
00:29:41,760 --> 00:29:44,160
This is just somewhere
I can get a free meal.

532
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:45,240
You ungrateful brat!

533
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:46,680
Who would feed you if it weren't for me?

534
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:49,680
Stay in your room today
and think about what you've done.

535
00:29:49,760 --> 00:29:51,080
Swallow your pride
and admit you're wrong.

536
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:53,640
Apologize to me now,

537
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,320
and I'll forget this ever happened.

538
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:57,240
No! No! I won't!

539
00:29:58,640 --> 00:30:00,600
-Jianwei!
-Yes, my lord.

540
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:02,880
Tell everyone.
Without my permission,

541
00:30:03,280 --> 00:30:06,120
she's not to have a single bite to eat,
or even a drop of water!

542
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:07,320
A drop of water?

543
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,440
I'll tell you what!

544
00:30:08,520 --> 00:30:10,360
I have my own!
I don't need yours!

545
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:12,680
With one mouthful of spit,
I could drown you!

546
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:14,200
-I don't need yours!
-Shrew!

547
